SavedSearchUpdateIn.description:
PUT is a full replace of the search itself (name, criteria, sorting, sharing).

``version`` is the optimistic lock. ``show_in_sidebar`` / ``show_count`` are ignored here;
the caller's own display settings are changed with ``PUT /saved-searches/{id}/prefs``.

get.description:
Bulk assignment counts keyed by group id (for AssignmentEditor badges).

Mirrors the editor filters: agent memberships use ``permission_key='rw'``;
role grants use ``permission_key='rw'`` and ``permission_value=1``.

post.description:
Queue an XLSX/CSV export (always a job; the file is ``<title slug>.xlsx|.csv``).

The request is checked now (422 for invalid definitions or parameters);
the worker evaluates access and the viewer's scope again when it runs.
